          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping and Returns",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li>Refunds are processed within 2 business days upon receiving and inspecting the returned product, and the amount will be credited to your original payment method within 7 business days.</li><li>A full refund is issued only if the complete product is returned; partial returns receive partial refunds.</li><li>Exchanges are available only for items with manufacturing defects or faults.</li><li>Return shipping is the customer’s responsibility and is non-refundable. For items over £99, we recommend using a trackable shipping service <a href=\"https://phoenixwaterfilters.co.uk/pages/terms-and-conditions\" title=\"Terms-and-conditions\">T&Cs apply.</a></li></ul>",
