        "heading2": "",
        "heading": "How do Carbon Cartridges work?",
        "heading_color": "#1e1e1e",
        "line_color": "#ff7a00",
        "line_width_desktop": 550,
        "line_width_mobile": 330,
        "left_content": "<ul><li>Our Smart Carbon Cartridges rely on mechanical filtration method. The dense porous wall captures physical contaminants like microplastics, sediments, bacteria, cysts and other physical impurities.</li><li>By way of adsorption, chemical contaminants like chlorine, PFAS, pesticides, and many other chemical molecules get adhered to the surface of the activated carbon.</li></ul>",
        "t1": 18,
        "t2": 18,
        "text_width": 1200,
        "cl1": "#2f2954",
